               10  CUR-YY      PIC XX.
               10  CUR-MM      PIC XX.
               10  CUR-DD      PIC XX.

       01  TIME-BUFFER.
           05  CUR-TIME.
               10  CUR-HRS     PIC XX.
               10  CUR-MIN     PIC XX.
